[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv RENAME TO w

[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv SET SCHEMA app

[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv SET TABLESPACE slow  -- Veri yeniden yazılır; ACCESS EXCLUSIVE kilidi alır

[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv SET TABLESPACE pg_default  -- Veri yeniden yazılır; ACCESS EXCLUSIVE kilidi alır

[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv SET (fillfactor = 90)

[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv RESET (fillfactor)

[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv OWNER TO b


[Safe] COMMENT ON MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv IS NULL

[Safe] COMMENT ON MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv IS 'd'
